% Test cases for the nebulizer policy (nebulizers.le): synthetic claims, one
% or two per criterion of LCD L33370 and per payment condition of Policy
% Article A52466, each stating only what its record shows. The diagnosis is a
% code of the article's ICD-10 table. The queries: whether the claim is
% payable (the first query, so "stage" reads its checklist), whether it is
% reasonable and necessary, and what minimal change would make it payable.

the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base nebulizers cases includes these resources:
    nebulizers.

the knowledge base nebulizers cases includes:

query pay is:
    which claim is payable.

query rn is:
    which claim is reasonable and necessary.

query stage is:
    the query fails at which section.

query flip is:
    which minimal change to the scenario makes it the case that
        claim 1 is payable.

% A complete first-month claim for a small volume nebulizer compressor
% (E0570) administering albuterol to a beneficiary with COPD (J44.1, group
% 8): every criterion and every documentation requirement in the record.
scenario compressor_complete is:
    claim 1 is for the nebulizer compressor.
    the HCPCS code of the nebulizer compressor is "E0570".
    the nebulizer compressor is furnished to Ann.
    the residence of Ann is private residence.
    the date of service of claim 1 is 2026-03-01.
    the rental month of claim 1 is 1.
    the diagnosis code of Ann is "J44.1".
    the HCPCS code of the albuterol is "J7613".
    the albuterol is administered with the nebulizer compressor.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor is dated 2026-02-20.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor is signed by the treating practitioner.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor includes beneficiary name.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor includes order date.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor includes description of the item.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor includes quantity to be dispensed.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor includes treating practitioner name.
    the order for the nebulizer compressor was communicated to the supplier on 2026-02-22.
    the nebulizer compressor was delivered on 2026-03-01.
    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the nebulizer compressor.
    pay expects answers ["claim 1 is payable"].
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary"].
    stage expects answers [].

% A complete claim for a month of albuterol (J7613, 300 units of 1 mg) for a
